 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.7,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really good, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "They've invited me to a group interview. Eight candidates at once. How does that even work?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Usually there are group tasks, like solving a problem together, while assessors watch how everyone interacts.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So do I need to be the loudest?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No, that often backfires. They tend to look for people who listen, build on others' ideas, and help the group get somewhere.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm quite quiet, though.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That can be a strength. Say something early so you're part of it, then try to bring in someone who hasn't spoken yet.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.98,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, that's a good trick.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It shows teamwork without needing to dominate. And keep an eye on the time if nobody else does.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg8"
  }
 ]
}
